From 1299a35d8f849b21770bfcdff9b17e7be9741b47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:49:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] Add Auto mode: card list, card editor, registry, field
 overlay and preview

An Auto toggle in the top bar swaps the Path List for the Auto's cards
and the Controls panel for the Auto panel, in the Visualizer's own
styles. Cards are added after the selection or into a selected branch,
moved, duplicated and deleted; decisions show a branch per row with its
condition, worst-case time and whether this preview took it.

The panel edits the selected card (action, path with while-driving chips,
a draggable events bar and the park flag, rows of waits and decisions),
the registry, alliance, export name and named points, and lists every
problem that blocks the export. Preview as sets when each condition
turns true; the playback bar and robot follow the simulated Auto, the
field draws each path in its branch colour with untaken ones dashed, and
a log tracks the 30 s budget.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
